    "new_fault_controls": "hold_address_clear retains only old DCFG address bits when clear is refused; uint8 hold_stall_clear_mask retains only prior STALL of selected IN0..3/OUT0..3. They affect external MMIO results and never touch driver requests, reset_pending or software halted.",
